WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.632 --> 00:00:02.141
- A lot of people consider mini golf

00:00:02.141 --> 00:00:05.320
to be very benign and
all fun and games but,

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:08.320
at this level, it can be
a cutthroat competition

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.653
among the greatest players in the world.

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:20.501
My name is Matt Male.

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:23.084
I'm a professional mini golfer.

00:00:24.531 --> 00:00:27.589
I was a regular golfer
ever since childhood.

00:00:27.589 --> 00:00:30.108
I started at about eight years old

00:00:30.108 --> 00:00:33.629
and putting was always the
greatest facet of my game.

00:00:33.629 --> 00:00:36.240
The idea of doing nothing
but putting for 18 holes

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.240
instantly appealed to me and I just began

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.657
practicing a lot.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.213
People don't realize that mini golf

00:00:43.213 --> 00:00:45.380
is a highly precise sport.

00:00:46.235 --> 00:00:49.635
Improvement can come very tediously.

00:00:49.635 --> 00:00:52.885
To be competitive, it really requires

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:55.635
an extensive mapping of each hole

00:00:56.864 --> 00:01:00.915
and we can be out here for
up to 10 hours a day or so,

00:01:00.915 --> 00:01:04.464
for several days, before a tournament.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.805
When I first arrive at a course,

00:01:06.805 --> 00:01:09.243
I diagnose the holes.

00:01:09.243 --> 00:01:12.715
I want to come up with a clear
plan of attack on each hole

00:01:12.715 --> 00:01:16.882
and then just, it's a matter
of repetition from there.

00:01:19.749 --> 00:01:23.253
We are at the 2016 mini golf masters

00:01:23.253 --> 00:01:25.595
in North Myrtle Beach, South Carolina.

00:01:25.595 --> 00:01:27.523
This tournament is the premiere event

00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:29.245
each year in mini golf.

00:01:29.245 --> 00:01:31.493
It draws players from all over the world.

00:01:31.493 --> 00:01:35.571
The green jacket is the most
coveted prize in mini golf.

00:01:35.571 --> 00:01:37.664
The competition is very fierce.

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.515
The players here are the best of the best

00:01:39.515 --> 00:01:41.725
and it's an immense challenge because

00:01:41.725 --> 00:01:44.104
even a stretch of five bad minutes

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:48.520
or 10 bad minutes can
disqualify you from contention.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.133
Just a tiny miscue here or there can spell

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:53.383
major disaster on one hole.

00:01:54.664 --> 00:01:57.754
I really do have an authentic admiration

00:01:57.754 --> 00:02:01.684
of what the winner had to do to perform

00:02:01.684 --> 00:02:04.915
under the pressure of
such a major tournament

00:02:04.915 --> 00:02:09.504
because I know from
experience how hard it is.

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:11.213
Mini golf's not a sport for everyone.

00:02:11.213 --> 00:02:12.605
There's constant frustration.

00:02:12.605 --> 00:02:14.635
There's constant adversity.

00:02:14.635 --> 00:02:19.273
It rewards patience and
it rewards determination

00:02:19.273 --> 00:02:22.824
and it never gets old to
see the ball go in the hole.

00:02:22.824 --> 00:02:26.491
I don't think that
thrill will ever go away.

